cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper and this software."
title: "Multi-Probe Compressive Phase Retrieval: Simulation Code and Data"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23716341
date-released: '2026-10-27'
authors:
  - family-names: Don
    given-names: Michael
license: BSD-3-Clause-Clear
repository-code: "https://github.com/mikedon1/multiprobe-compressive-phase-retrieval"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB code and data for the simulations in "Compressive Phase Retrieval for
  Multi-Probe Antenna Measurement Systems" (M. Don and G. R. Arce): compressive
  phase retrieval of antenna patterns from amplitude-only multi-probe measurements
  with on/off switches and a spherical-wave sparse representation, a comparison
  with the two-scan phaseless technique, and a full-wave example with
  embedded-probe calibration from HFSS.
keywords:
  - compressive sensing
  - phase retrieval
  - antenna measurement
  - multi-probe